# 📊 SPSS Analysis

This folder contains the SPSS file used for the statistical analysis of the research project.

## Research Topic

**A Study on the Influence of Product Placement on Impulse Buying Behaviour Among College Students in Retail Stores**

## Purpose

The SPSS file contains the collected responses, variable definitions, coding, and statistical analysis used in the study.

## Analyses Included

- Pearson Correlation
- Spearman Rank Correlation
- Linear Regression
- Multiple Regression
- One-Sample T-Test
- Paired-Samples T-Test

## Software

**IBM SPSS Statistics**

## File

**SPSS_Project_Analysis.sav**

The file contains the data and analysis used to prepare the results presented in the final research report.
